meta {
  name: List Chat Sessions
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{communicationBaseUrl}}:8127/
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
}

docs {
  functions-communication: ListChatSessions (port 8127). Sessions the
  caller participates in — plain-HTTP mirror of a query that's already
  client-legal per Security Rules (§3), added because the frontend moved
  off the Firestore client SDK — see root README.md. Sign in as
  nursery-acorn or staff-jane to see session-1 (seeded for shift-booked-1),
  or run this after accepting a shift with WITH_TRIGGERS=1 / devharness
  running so onShiftBooked actually creates a session.
}
